gaLa(){return"Add stocks to your Watchlist to see whether you should have bought them instead of (or in addition to) your current holdings."},
gaLb(){return"Compares watched stocks' price returns since you started watching them against your portfolio's average price return (excluding dividends).\n\nBoth figures use price change only, so the comparison is like-for-like. Helps you see which stocks on your watchlist you missed out on \u2014 and whether sitting on the sidelines cost you."},
